<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>NIHR Research Support Service (RSS) — Guide for SMEs</title>
  <style>
    :root { --navy:#1b2a5e; --red:#e2231a; --lightblue:#eaf3fb; --grey:#f4f5f7; --text:#222; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    body { font-family:'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; margin:0; color:var(--text); line-height:1.6; background:#fff; }
    header { background:var(--navy); color:#fff; padding:40px 20px; text-align:center; }
    header .logo { font-weight:bold; font-size:1.2rem; letter-spacing:1px; }
    header .logo span { color:var(--red); }
    header h1 { font-size:2.2rem; margin:20px 0 10px; }
    header p.subtitle { font-style:italic; font-size:1.1rem; margin:0; color:#dfe6f5; }
    header p.version { font-size:0.9rem; margin-top:20px; color:#b9c4e0; }
    nav { background:var(--grey); padding:15px 20px; text-align:center; border-bottom:3px solid var(--navy); position:sticky; top:0; z-index:100; }
    nav a { color:var(--navy); text-decoration:none; margin:0 10px; font-weight:600; font-size:0.9rem; }
    nav a:hover { color:var(--red); text-decoration:underline; }
    main { max-width:1000px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 20px 60px; }
    section { padding:40px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #e0e0e0; }
    section h2 { background:var(--navy); color:#fff; padding:14px 20px; border-radius:4px; font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:20px; }
    section h3 { color:var(--navy); border-left:4px solid var(--red); padding-left:10px; margin-top:30px; }
    .callout { background:var(--lightblue); border-left:4px solid var(--navy); padding:15px 20px; margin:20px 0; border-radius:4px; }
    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:20px 0; font-size:0.92rem; }
    table caption { text-align:left; font-weight:600; color:var(--navy); margin-bottom:8px; }
    th, td { border:1px solid #ddd; padding:10px 12px; text-align:left; vertical-align:top; }
    th { background:var(--navy); color:#fff; }
    tr:nth-child(even) { background:var(--grey); }
    ul, ol { padding-left:22px; }
    li { margin-bottom:6px; }
    .journey-step { display:flex; gap:20px; margin-bottom:15px; align-items:flex-start; }
    .journey-num { background:var(--red); color:#fff; border-radius:50%; min-width:34px; height:34px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:bold; flex-shrink:0; }
    .faq-item { margin-bottom:18px; padding:15px; background:var(--grey); border-radius:6px; }
    .faq-item strong { color:var(--navy); display:block; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .trl-badge { display:inline-block; background:var(--navy); color:#fff; padding:2px 10px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; }
    footer { background:var(--navy); color:#dfe6f5; text-align:center; padding:30px 20px; font-size:0.9rem; }
    footer a { color:#fff; text-decoration:underline; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header id="top">
    <div class="logo">NIHR <span>|</span> Research Support Service</div>
    <h1>NIHR Research Support Service (RSS)</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">How we can support your innovation from research design to NHS adoption</p>
    <p class="version">Working with the RSS: A Guide for SMEs &nbsp;|&nbsp; Version 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; July 2026</p>
  </header>
  <nav>
    <a href="#section1">What is RSS?</a>
    <a href="#section2">Eligibility</a>
    <a href="#section3">Scope</a>
    <a href="#section4">Your Journey</a>
  </nav>
  <main>
    <section id="section1">
      <h2>Section 1: What is the NIHR Research Support Service?</h2>
      <p>The NIHR Research Support Service (RSS) is a free, expert service that helps researchers — including companies like yours — design and deliver high-quality health and care research.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
